Emmylou Harris first recorded this Everley Brothers hit accompanying Gram Parsons. She
recorded a live version on her album 'Spyboy' with her Spyboy Band. This version is with
the same band from an unknown live performance (possibly in Germany) with Buddy Miller
accompanying Emmylou from an iTunes released album, 'Hickory Wind'.

